      "en": "The burden of the valley of vision. What ails you now, that you have all gone up to the housetops?",
      "ko": "이상 골짜기에 관한 경고라 네가 지붕에 올라감은 어찜인고",
      "source_text_hash": "e1bb0f3af4982e9a1580654c18840aa1888336cd7aa0ec6b8d62be5c5111cca2",
      "translation_text_hash": "73ddaecf5a41288a7216f0ac8208c3ca729dd8351df7f01ccfd6410bb928b91f",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "이상 골짜기에 관한 경고라 네가 지붕에 올라감은 어찜인고"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "73ddaecf5a41288a7216f0ac8208c3ca729dd8351df7f01ccfd6410bb928b91f"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:ISA:22:2",
      "sequence": 18055,
      "chapter_label": "ISA 22",
      "verse_label": "2",
      "locator": {
        "book": "ISA",
