      "en": "You saw the breaches of David’s city, that they were many; and you gathered together the waters of the lower pool.",
      "ko": "너희가 다윗성의 무너진 곳이 많은 것도 보며 너희가 아래 못의 물도 모으며",
      "source_text_hash": "ec1ab90b1ec5ac3ca9aa8b0265623b6bf86b5e025cb2aca362914e07de1deabf",
      "translation_text_hash": "d244e650816c5eb6b72c89b732e1850c39f4fd15025b54da1cf0d9647e1a9c8a",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
