      "en": "You counted the houses of Jerusalem, and you broke down the houses to fortify the wall.",
      "ko": "또 예루살렘의 가옥을 계수하며 그 가옥을 헐어 성벽을 견고케도 하며",
      "source_text_hash": "c88e2cbc4a033580b1e4b8ebafdb7cc043a65dc3ccf738fa075e6074104f61d3",
      "translation_text_hash": "43b1573d31289d28f521b0c9e3b222b6e74b914dd21e08e83627f0c1ee2447ab",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
